# ISSUE-042: the pinned CI debug keystore is committed ON PURPOSE so every
# CI test build shares one stable debug signature (update-installs keep app
# data). It is a TEST-ONLY keystore with the public AOSP debug credentials
# (alias androiddebugkey / password android) - never use it for release.
